# A live 23ai Free reply to seerdb's fast-auth bundle (PRO, DTY and OSESSKEY)
# on a service created with COMMIT_OUTCOME => true (Transaction Guard), captured
# through a relay (#2654). After the challenge's pairs come two server
# piggybacks: the Application Continuity replay context (17 08) and the
# session's logical transaction id (17 07: a ub4 length 56, then the 56 bytes
# with their own length). A service without COMMIT_OUTCOME sends neither.
